  "text_pages": [
    "GACHON UNIVERSITY - Admission\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nPeriod of Exchange\nOne Semester or One Academic Year (According to the Student Exchange Agreement between two universities.)\nEligibility\nCompletion of at least two semesters of study and currently in the process of pursuing a degree at home institution.\nGPA Higher than 2.5/4.5\nApplication Time Table\nBefore the nomination, exchange coordinators MUST consult with Gachon inbound exchange program coordinator about the number of student nominees.\nOnce the number of nominees has been confirmed, the exchange coordinators may send the scanned copy of all the required documents for application to Gachon University by the deadline via an email.\nTo nominate a master's student, prior consultation is mandatory.\n(Currently, only the Deapartment of Computer Engineering is available for the Master's English-taught program.)\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
